13. P2 BUSINESS BOUNDARIES
==========================

These cases require specific purchase orders with prepared test data.

13.1 Threshold equality
-----------------------
Condition:
- PO total equals threshold exactly.

Expected:
- The PO belongs to the under tab.
- The PO does not belong to the over tab.

13.2 Review day boundary
------------------------
Condition:
- The PO was reviewed in the previous month.
- Compare execution on day 6 and day 7 of the current month.

Expected:
- Day 6: review is kept.
- Day 7: review is reset.
